{"id":"459e3bda75899406","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-class-number.md","title":"Class Number","display":"df-class-number — Class Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-class-number","aliases":["58-df-class-number"],"display":"df-class-number — Class Number","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-ideal-class-group.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-class-number"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-class-number</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-class-number — Class Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2a057f83805b06e9\" href=\"?note=2a057f83805b06e9\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-ideal-class-group.md\">../batch03/58-df-ideal-class-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,G,h\\in V\">\\(K,G,h\\in V\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NumberField}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{NumberField}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cl}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cl}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2a057f83805b06e9\" href=\"?note=2a057f83805b06e9\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-ideal-class-group.md\">../batch03/58-df-ideal-class-group.md</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassNumber}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassNumber}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}number}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ClassNumber}_S(h,K)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{NumberField}(K)\\land\n\\exists G\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cl}_S(G,K)\\land h=|G|\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}number}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ClassNumber}_S(h,K)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{NumberField}(K)\\land\n\\exists G\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cl}_S(G,K)\\land h=|G|\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This definition reuses the ideal-class-group predicate instead of introducing a second unsourced operator.</li>\n<li>Finiteness of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> for number fields is a theorem (for example via Minkowski theory), not an extra defining clause.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-ideal-class-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"2a057f83805b06e9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-ideal-class-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-ideal-class-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"2a057f83805b06e9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{NumberField}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\mathrm{Cl}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch03/58-df-ideal-class-group.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的最小等势序数，使用 [[58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K,G,h\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NumberField}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cl}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClassNumber}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}number}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ClassNumber}_S(h,K)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{NumberField}(K)\\land\n\\exists G\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cl}_S(G,K)\\land h=|G|\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"h","display":false}],"bytes":1065,"backlinks":[{"id":"b5a73a9da7e1ce01","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-283","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-class-number.md|58-df-class-number]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["2a057f83805b06e9","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}